data: {"type":"agent_chunk","agent":"critic","content":"- **Single-source claims:** The HIV result and the \"many diseases\" headlines each rest on one source. Corroborate them, and name the diseases.\n- **Missing limits:** The hype section omits off-target cuts and delivery problems, which are central to judging clinical readiness.\n- **Overstated mechanism:** Insertion and replacement need a repair template alongside the guide RNA. The bullet presents these as automatic."}

